nual coordination contributed to high overheads while taking senior staff away from sales, strategy and client engagement\"}],\"solution\":{\"intro\":\"Big Beast: AI-powered Operating System\",\"descMain\":\"Connects and automates client delivery, reporting, finance and internal operations\",\"descSub\":\"Big Beast embeds AI agents across business workflows to execute routine processes, while retaining human approval for consequential actions\",\"items\":[{\"title\":\"Automated client reporting\",\"desc\":\"Pulls advertising and SEO data, tracks keyword performance and generates AI-assisted campaign summaries and live reports\"},{\"title\":\"AI-enabled finance workflows\",\"desc\":\"Automates invoicing, bank reconciliation and accounting workflows, with human approval for financial actions\"},{\"title\":\"Integrated business operations\",\"desc\":\"Brings task management, payroll, CPF computation, HR processes and contract e-signing into one platform\"},{\"title\":\"AI-assisted content and quality control\",\"desc\":\"Drafts SEO content, advertisements and landing pages, with automated quality and compliance checks supporting human review\"},{\"title\":\"Automated client and lead management\",\"desc\":\"Routes leads to relevant teams, flags unanswered enquiries and identifies renewal risks using campaign and payment records\"}]}},{\"index\":2,\"listIndex\":0,\"target\":\"Blue Aqua International\",\"name\":\"Blue Aqua International\",\"tagline\":\"Uses AI to improve feed efficiency by around 30%\",\"sectors\":[\"Aquaculture\"],\"logo\":\"https://services2.imda.gov.sg/ctoaas_assets/ai-awards/blueaqua.png\",\"description\":\"Provides sustainable aquaculture, animal nutrition and farm management solutions to farmers worldwide\",\"stats\":[{\"main\":\"30% improvement\",\"sub\":\"in managing production cost\"},{\"main\":\"6–9 % higher\",\"sub\":\"survival rates\"},{\"main\":\"Around 2,500 manpower\",\"sub\":\"hours saved annually\"}],\"challenges\":[{\"title\":\"Limited visibility of farm conditions\",\"desc\":\"Infrequent water quality checks meant issues could go undetected between readings, increasing the risk of losses\"},{\"title\":\"Reactive feeding and disease management\",\"desc\":\"Generic feeding led to inefficient feed use and spending, while late disease detection increased the risk of stock losses\"},{\"title\":\"Fragmented decision-making\",\"desc\":\"Farm decisions relied heavily on individual experience, paper logs and inconsistent records, making performance difficult to compare across farms\"}],\"solution\":{\"intro\":\"AquaPilot: AI-driven Aquaculture Intelligence Platform\",\"descMain\":\"Predicts farm risks and recommends actions using real-time aquaculture data\",\"descSub\":\"AquaPilot analyses water quality, feeding, health and production data to translate Blue Aqua's aquaculture expertise into consistent, data-driven farm decisions\",\"items\":[{\"title\":\"Predictive water quality management\",\"desc\":\"Analyses sensor and farm data to forecast oxygen, ammonia and temperature 6 to 24 hours ahead and alert teams to potential issues\"},{\"title\":\"AI-enabled disease risk detection\",\"desc\":\"Generates daily pond-level risk scores and flags potential health issues 4 to 7 days before they typically become visible\"},{\"title\":\"AI-powered feed optimisation\",\"desc\":\"Calculates daily feed requirements for each pond based on biomass, water conditions, growth patterns and health risks\"},{\"title\":\"AI-assisted system management\",\"desc\":\"Monitors the Recirculating Aquaculture System to predict potential issues and adjust feeding accordingly\"},{\"title\":\"Data-driven farm intelligence\",\"desc\":\"Benchmarks ponds on feed conversion, survival, growth and production cost and provides farm-specific recommendations to increase farm yield\"}]}},{\"index\":3,\"listIndex\":0,\"target\":\"GetGo Technologies\",\"name\":\"GetGo Technologies\",\"tagline\":\"Uses AI to detect vehicle damage and recovers $20,000 in billings\",\"sectors\":[\"Transport & Mobility\"],\"logo\":\"https://services2.imda.gov.sg/ctoaas_assets/ai-awards/getgo.png\",\"description\":\"Provides on-demand carsharing on a pay-as-you-drive basis\",\"stats\":[{\"main\":\"53% reduction\",\"sub\":\"in lead time for damage-to-invoices\"},{\"main\":\"60% less\",\"sub\":\"manual review workload\"},{\"main\":\"S$20,000 recovered\",\"sub\":\"in damage costs within two months\"}],\"challenges\":[{\"title\":\"Impractical manual screening\",\"desc\":\"Around 7,000 daily bookings generate about 56,000 end-trip photos, making it impractical to manually inspect every booking for damage\"},{\"title\":\"Delayed damage detection\",\"desc\":\"Vehicle damage could go unnoticed until reported by users or discovered during workshop inspection days or weeks later\"},{\"title\":\"Difficulty recovering damage costs\",\"desc\":\"Late detection made it difficult to attribute damage to the responsible booking, resulting in cost of repair that cannot be recovered\"}],\"solution\":{\"intro\":\"Project Desmond: AI-powered Vehicle Damage Detection\",\"descMain\":\"Auto detects vehicle damage to reduce damage costs\",\"descSub\":\"Combines computer vision, image matching and human validation to identify vehicle damage, determine when it occurred and support accurate billing\",\"items\":[{\"title\":\"AI vehicle damage detection\",\"desc\":\"Analyses end-trip photos to detect billable damage such as scratches, dents, cracks and dangling parts\"},{\"title\":\"Booking-level damage attribution\",\"desc\":\"Compares consecutive bookings to determine when damage first appeared and link it to the relevant booking\"},{\"title\":\"AI-powered image matching\",\"desc\":\"Uses image embeddings to determine whether detected damage is new or recurring across adjacent bookings\"},{\"title\":\"Human-validated damage workflow\",\"desc\":\"Routes AI-flagged cases to human reviewers for validation before confirmed cases proceed for follow-up and billing\"},{\"title\":\"Continuous AI model improvement\",\"desc\":\"Retrains the model using real-world failure cases such as rain and reflections to improve precision and reduce false positives\"}]}},{\"index\":4,\"listIndex\":0,\"target\":\"Glints Singapore\",\"name\":\"Glints Singapore\",\"tagline\":\"Uses AI to speed up internal knowledge searches by around 90%\",\"sectors\":[\"Talent & Recruitment\"],\"logo\":\"https://services2.imda.gov.sg/ctoaas_assets/ai-awards/glints.png\",\"description\":\"Provides talent and managed workforce services across Singapore, Malaysia, Indonesia, Vietnam, the Philippines and Taiwan.\",\"stats\":[{\"main\":\"90% reduction\",\"sub\":\"in time spent fact-finding\"},{\"main\":\"1,700 specialist hours\",\"sub\":\"saved in six months\"},{\"main\":\"S$120,000 worth\",\"sub\":\"of staff time saved a year\"}],\"challenges\":[{\"title\":\"Fragmented company knowledge\",\"desc\":\"Critical information was spread across databases, business systems and employment laws in six different markets\"},{\"title\":\"Slow responses to queries\",\"desc\":\"Routine questions often required help from Finance, Engineering or other specialists, with complex queries taking hours or days\"},{\"title\":\"Operational and compliance risks\",\"desc\":\"Repeated queries distracted specialists from their work, while inconsistent answers created regulatory risks across different markets\"}],\"solution\":{\"intro\":\"Glimmer: Knowledge Mining AI Agent\",\"descMain\":\"Connects company data and knowledge to help employees answer customers’ questions\",\"descSub\":\"Glimmer lets employees ask questions in plain language and retrieves answers from company systems, internal knowledge, source code and employment laws\",\"items\":[{\"title\":\"Unified AI knowledge assistant\",\"desc\":\"Answers questions in plain language using company data and internal knowledge, with supporting sources shown\"},{\"title\":\"Real-time enterprise data retrieval\",\"desc\":\"Retrieves up-to-date client, employee, invoice and billing information from systems such as NetSuite and HubSpot\"},{\"title\":\"AI-enabled technical support\",\"desc\":\"Reads the company&apos;s source code to answer platform questions and provide first-line support before unresolved issues are escalated\"},{\"title\":\"Built-in accuracy and governance\",\"desc\":\"System automatically flags missing information, restricts citations to accessed sources and maintains audit logs\"}]}},{\"index\":5,\"listIndex\":0,\"target\":\"Greenphyto\",\"name\":\"Greenphyto\",\"tagline\":\"Uses AI to improve crop inspection time by 10X\",\"sectors\":[\"Agriculture\"],\"logo\":\"https://services2.imda.gov.sg/ctoaas_assets/ai-awards/greenphyto.png\",\"description\":\"Operates a high-density indoor vertical farm for large-scale crop production\",\"stats\":[{\"main\":\"10x faster\",\"sub\":\"in crop inspection time\"},{\"main\":\"Up to 150x\",\"sub\":\"productivity improvement\"},{\"main\":\"90% crop yield\",\"sub\":\"consistency\"}],\"challenges\":[{\"title\":\"Late detection of crop issues\",\"desc\":\"Plant defects and abnormal growth are not detected timely for intervention\"},{\"title\":\"Manual inspections\",\"desc\":\"Crop and equipment checks relied heavily on people and multiple systems\"},{\"title\":\"Challenging yield forecasting\",\"desc\":\"Limited continuous crop measurements made harvest planning difficult\"}],\"solution\":{\"intro\":\"AI-powered Farm Operations Management System (FOMS™)\",\"descMain\":\"Connects farm data, images, sensors and workflows into one system\",\"descSub\":\"Uses AI to support decisions and improve production efficiency, moving farm operations from manual monitoring to a continuous, data-driven model.\",\"items\":[{\"title\":\"Early defect detection\",\"desc\":\"Detects crop growth issues, defects and abnormalities earlier using computer vision for early intervention\"},{\"title\":\"Faster inspections\",\"desc\":\"Replaces many manual crop checks with AI-powered image checks\"},{\"title\":\"More accurate harvest planning\",\"desc\":\"Improves yield forecasting by analysing farm data with AI\"},{\"title\":\"Less manual intervention\",\"desc\":\"Integrates farm systems, sensors and workflows to reduce manual work\"},{\"title\":\"Real-time alerts\",\"desc\":\"Flags issues such as lighting or device problems for timely follow-up\"}]}},{\"index\":6,\"listIndex\":0,\"target\":\"iAPPS Health Group\",\"name\":\"iAPPS Health Group\",\"tagline\":\"Uses AI to help doctors manage up to four times more patients\",\"sectors\":[\"Healthcare\"],\"logo\":\"https://services2.imda.gov.sg/ctoaas_assets/ai-awards/iappshealthgroup.png\",\"description\":\"Provides primary care, preventive health and diagnostic services supported by proprietary digital health infrastructure\",\"stats\":[{\"main\":\"Up to 4x increase\",\"sub\":\"in doctor productivity\"},{\"main\":\"Up to 10x increase\",\"sub\":\"in health coach productivity\"},{\"main\":\"Up to 4x revenue growth\",\"sub\":\"across AI-enabled clinics\"}],\"challenges\":[{\"title\":\"Manpower-intensive operations\",\"desc\":\"Pharmacy, claims and finance processes required significant administrative resources as clinic operations grew\"},{\"title\":\"Fragmented and reactive care\",\"desc\":\"Patient records, pharmacy, claims, finance and workforce management were spread across isolated systems\"},{\"title\":\"Difficult to scale consistently\",\"desc\":\"Uneven workload and limited decision support made it difficult to expand while maintaining consistent care quality\"}],\"solution\":{\"intro\":\"1docAI: AI-native Healthcare Operating System\",\"descMain\":\"Integrates AI across patient care, clinical decisions and healthcare operations\",\"descSub\":\"1docAI connects six AI domains across patient care, clinical decision-making, health coaching, pharmacy, enterprise operations and payments\",\"items\":[{\"title\":\"AI-enabled patient management\",\"desc\":\"Coordinates appointments, live queues and follow-ups to support patient flow and continuity of care\"},{\"title\":\"AI-assisted clinical decision support\",\"desc\":\"Retrieves source-linked clinical evidence, supports diagnostic reasoning and applies safety checks, with final decisions made by doctors\"},{\"title\":\"Personalised health coaching\",\"desc\":\"Uses longitudinal health data and behavioural intelligence to provide personalised, real-time coaching between consultations\"},{\"title\":\"Automated pharmacy and enterprise operations\",\"desc\":\"Automates dispensing, inventory, claims, finance, reconciliation, HR and workforce rostering\"},{\"title\":\"Integrated healthcare and payments\",\"desc\":\"Connects clinical, operational and payment workflows through a shared longitudinal data record\"}]}},{\"index\":7,\"listIndex\":0,\"target\":\"Kyanon Digital\",\"name\":\"Kyanon Digital\",\"tagline\":\"Uses AI to cut new AI project setup time by 83%\",\"sectors\":[\"ICT/Consultancy\"],\"logo\":\"https://services2.imda.gov.sg/ctoaas_assets/ai-awards/kyanon.png\",\"description\":\"Digital technology company and agile software development firm specialising in end-to-end digital transformation, data analytics, and enterprise IT solutions.\",\"stats\":[{\"main\":\"83% reduction\",\"sub\":\"in setup time for new AI engagements\"},{\"main\":\"80x faster\",\"sub\":\"business-rule changes\"},{\"main\":\"75% increase\",\"sub\":\"in concurrent AI delivery capacity\"}],\"challenges\":[{\"title\":\"Repetitive & long lead time for development work\",\"desc\":\"Teams had to rebuild common capabilities for orchestral, retrieval, integrations, AI evaluation and monitoring before client-specific development could begin\"},{\"title\":\"Heavy reliance on AI engineers\",\"desc\":\"Business-rules were embedded in application code with routine rule changes requiring around five working days of engineering effort, while AI quality checks also relied heavily on manual review\"},{\"title\":\"Limited planning flexibility\",\"desc\":\"The company could support around four concurrent AI engagements without adding senior AI engineers at a similar rate, limiting its ability to grow efficiently even as demand increased\"}],\"solution\":{\"intro\":\"WisdomMind: Enterprise AI Platform\",\"descMain\":\"Standardises core AI capabilities, business rules, integrations and quality controls for faster deployment\",\"descSub\":\"WisdomMind allows teams to start from a governed production framework and adapt it to each client engagement\",\"items\":[{\"title\":\"Reusable AI foundation\",\"desc\":\"Shared capabilities for AI-agent orchestration, retrieval, integrations and deployment, allowing new engagements to start from proven platform capabilities instead of building from scratch\"},{\"title\":\"Governed business-rule management\",\"desc\":\"Separates business rules from application code, allowing authorised teams to update rules directly while evaluation, versioning and approval controls are applied before changes reach production\"},{\"title\":\"Automated AI quality evaluation\",\"desc\":\"Tests AI changes against defined ground-truth scenarios and business rules before deployment, helping teams identify regressions consistently\"},{\"title\":\"Reusable enterprise integrations\",\"desc\":\"Provides shared integration and tool interfaces that can be built once and reused across AI agents and client engagements\"},{\"title\":\"End-to-end AI monitoring\",\"desc\":\"Tracks AI execution, latency, errors and inference costs, giving teams visibility to diagnose issues and optimise production workloads\"}]}},{\"index\":8,\"listIndex\":0,\"target\":\"Limteh Project\",\"name\":\"Limteh Project\",\"tagline\":\"Uses AI to reduce 80% rework on orders\",\"sectors\":[\"Retail\"],\"logo\":\"https://services2.imda.gov.sg/ctoaas_assets/ai-awards/limteh.png\",\"description\":\"Creates customised corporate gifts, gift sets and personalised presents\",\"stats\":[{\"main\":\"80% less\",\"sub\":\"rework on orders\"},{\"main\":\"More than 20 hours\",\"sub\":\"saved each week\"},{\"main\":\"Up to $5,800\",\"sub\":\"saved monthly\"}],\"challenges\":[{\"title\":\"Complex personalised orders\",\"desc\":\"Personalisation details from customers through order notes, customer chats and messages in different languages\"},{\"title\":\"Labour-intensive order processing\",\"desc\":\"Staff manually process around 2,500 orders each month, creating a daily production bottleneck\"},{\"title\":\"Costly errors\",\"desc\":\"Order mistakes resulted in reprints, reshipping, wasted materials and unhappy customers\"}],\"solution\":{\"intro\":\"Milo: AI-powered Order Automation\",\"descMain\":\"Automates personalised orders from sales to production\",\"descSub\":\"Milo interprets customer orders and prepares production instructions, while AI verification helps improve accuracy and flags uncertain orders for review\",\"items\":[{\"title\":\"AI order interpretation\",\"desc\":\"Reads orders and chats across marketplaces to identify each customer’s personalisation requirements\"},{\"title\":\"Automated production preparation\",\"desc\":\"Turns customer requirements into production instructions and automates print-file preparation\"},{\"title\":\"AI-powered verification\",\"desc\":\"Cross-checks order details and flags uncertainties for staff review\"},{\"title\":\"Continuous improvement\",\"desc\":\"Learns from staff corrections to improve order processing over time\"},{\"title\":\"Business and marketing automation\",\"desc\":\"Automates sales reporting, stock alerts, profit-and-loss dashboards and creation of marketing content\"}]}},{\"index\":9,\"listIndex\":0,\"target\":\"Lithan Academy\",\"name\":\"Lithan Academy\",\"tagline\":\"Uses AI to cut curriculum development time by 75%\",\"sectors\":[\"Education\"],\"logo\":\"https://services2.imda.gov.sg/ctoaas_assets/ai-awards/lithan.png\",\"description\":\"Provides adult education to bridge AI skills for a productive workforce\",\"stats\":[{\"main\":\"75% faster\",\"sub\":\"curriculum development\"},{\"main\":\"60% less\",\"sub\":\"manual monitoring and support\"},{\"main\":\"About 60%\",\"sub\":\"year-on-year revenue growth\"}],\"challenges\":[{\"title\":\"Lengthy curriculum development\",\"desc\":\"A 60-hour module required around 300 staff hours to map competencies, prepare content, assessments and rubrics\"},{\"title\":\"Difficulty scaling personalised learner support\",\"desc\":\"Learners progressed at different speeds, while limited trainer capacity made it difficult to provide timely, customised support\"},{\"title\":\"Delayed learner intervention\",\"desc\":\"Attendance, assignments and programme progress tracked separately, making it harder to spot learner issues in-time.\"}],\"solution\":{\"intro\":\"Adaptive CLaaS: AI-powered Personalised Learning System\",\"descMain\":\"Reduces curriculum work and extends personalised support beyond trainer capacity\",\"descSub\":\"Comprises three integrated modules: CLaaS Developer for curriculum development, CLaaS Mentor for personalised learner experience and CLaaS Manager for learner monitoring & management\",\"items\":[{\"title\":\"AI-assisted curriculum development\",\"desc\":\"CLaaS Developer uses generative AI to create first drafts of learning pathways, session plans, content and assessments, with AI-assisted quality checks and curriculum teams reviewing and refining outputs\"},{\"title\":\"Adaptive personalised learning\",\"desc\":\"CLaaS Mentor adjusts learning pace and difficulty based on learner progress and recommends resources for identified gaps\"},{\"title\":\"AI-powered learner support\",\"desc\":\"Provides on-demand guidance, reminders and automated assessment feedback, while escalating learners that need more support\"},{\"title\":\"Data-driven learner management\",\"desc\":\"CLaaS Manager consolidates enrolment, attendance, assignment completion and programme progress into a 360 view\"},{\"title\":\"Human-in-the-loop learning delivery\",\"desc\":\"AI handles repetitive curriculum development and routine learner guidance, while curriculum teams and trainers retain responsibility for content quality and complex interventions\"}]}},{\"index\":10,\"listIndex\":0,\"target\":\"Mencast Marine\",\"name\":\"Mencast Marine\",\"tagline\":\"Uses AI to generate $900,000 in new revenue\",\"sectors\":[\"Marine and Offshore Energy\"],\"logo\":\"https://services2.imda.gov.sg/ctoaas_assets/ai-awards/mencast.png\",\"description\":\"Provides marine propulsion design, manufacturing and repair for the global marine and offshore industry\",\"stats\":[{\"main\":\"50% faster\",\"sub\":\"design turnaround\"},{\"main\":\"75% higher\",\"sub\":\"productivity for knowledge-intensive tasks\"},{\"main\":\"$900,000 new\",\"sub\":\"revenue within 18 months\"}],\"challenges\":[{\"title\":\"Time-consuming design process\",\"desc\":\"Conventional methods restrict the number of options engineers could evaluate, slowing complex projects\"},{\"title\":\"Pressure to lower design costs\",\"desc\":\"Growing competition from lower-cost players reduced margins and placed pressure on Mencast's design-led business\"},{\"title\":\"Labour-intensive and manual operations\",\"desc\":\"Lengthy production cycles and manual information retrieval slowed quotations, workflows and operational efficiency\"}],\"solution\":{\"intro\":\"Mencast AI Platform (MAIP)\",\"descMain\":\"Uses AI to enhance propulsion design, manufacturing and operational workflows\",\"descSub\":\"MAIP combines AI, computer vision and enterprise knowledge automation to improve productivity, streamline workflows and centralise data access\",\"items\":[{\"title\":\"AI-powered propulsion design\",\"desc\":\"Analyses thousands of design possibilities to identify higher-performing options and shorten the design process\"},{\"title\":\"Design differentiation\",\"desc\":\"Leverages decades of engineering and sea-trial data to develop differentiated propulsion solutions beyond competing primarily on price\"},{\"title\":\"Intelligent manufacturing optimisation\",\"desc\":\"Combines AI, computer vision and sensors to improve quality and support more efficient production\"},{\"title\":\"Enterprise knowledge automation\",\"desc\":\"Organises enterprise knowledge and automates workflows such as quotations, claims processing, research and information retrieval\"}]}},{\"index\":11,\"listIndex\":0,\"target\":\"Oceanus Media Global\",\"name\":\"Oceanus Media Global\",\"tagline\":\"Uses AI to cut production timelines by around 80%\",\"sectors\":[\"Media & Creative\"],\"logo\":\"https://services2.imda.gov.sg/ctoaas_assets/ai-awards/Oceanus%20Media%20Global_Logo.png\",\"description\":\"Creative media technology company specialising in virtual production, generative AI, content production, distribution and IP licensing\",\"stats\":[{\"main\":\"80% shorter\",\"sub\":\"production timelines\"},{\"main\":\"Up to 85% lower\",\"sub\":\"production costs\"},{\"main\":\"200% increase\",\"sub\":\"in multi-location project capacity\"}],\"challenges\":[{\"title\":\"Long production timelines\",\"desc\":\"Multi-location productions could take 14-15 weeks due to location scouting, permits, travel, set construction and filming\"},{\"title\":\"High production costs\",\"desc\":\"Location fees, permits, travel, transport and set construction increased production costs significantly\"},{\"title\":\"Limited production capacity\",\"desc\":\"Crews and equipment were largely committed to one major production at a time, limiting the number of projects the company could take on concurrently\"}],\"solution\":{\"intro\":\"AI-integrated Virtual Production Pipeline\",\"descMain\":\"Creates multiple locations virtually for faster, more efficient media production\",\"descSub\":\"Combines generative AI, computer vision and AI agents across pre-production, filming, post-production and localisation, with creative control retained by the team\",\"items\":[{\"title\":\"AI-assisted pre-production\",\"desc\":\"Supports script breakdown, scene planning, scheduling, storyboarding and visualisation before filming\"},{\"title\":\"AI-generated virtual environments\",\"desc\":\"Creates digital environments and reconstructs real locations as virtual sets for filming in a controlled studio\"},{\"title\":\"AI-enabled filming\",\"desc\":\"Films actors against AI-built virtual environments, with real-time camera tracking maintaining correct perspective\"},{\"title\":\"AI-supported visual effects\",\"desc\":\"Automates repetitive editing tasks and supports the creation of visual-effects elements\"},{\"title\":\"AI-powered localisation and versioning\",\"desc\":\"Supports dubbing in four languages and adapts approved content for different formats and platforms\"}]}},{\"index\":12,\"listIndex\":0,\"target\":\"ONG&ONG Group\",\"name\":\"ONG&ONG Group\",\"tagline\":\"Uses AI to cut workflow durations by up to 95%\",\"sectors\":[\"Built Environment\"],\"logo\":\"https://services2.imda.gov.sg/ctoaas_assets/ai-awards/ongandong.png\",\"description\":\"Provides built environment consultancy services across Asia, integrating architectural practice, urban master planning, landscape design, interior design and project management with comprehensive civil, structural, mechanical and electrical engineering\",\"stats\":[{\"main\":\"Up to 95% savings\",\"sub\":\"in workflow duration\"},{\"main\":\"22,500 professional hours\",\"sub\":\"estimated to be recovered annually\"},{\"main\":\"Approx. 4x return\",\"sub\":\"on AI investment\"}],\"challenges\":[{\"title\":\"Time-consuming information retrieval\",\"desc\":\"Up to 2,750 manhours a week spent searching for project precedents, building regulations, policies and project information scattered across multiple systems\"},{\"title\":\"Reliance on staff knowledge\",\"desc\":\"Technical expertise sat with experienced staff, while accessing knowledge from past projects required staff to know the exact reference to search for\"},{\"title\":\"Labour-intensive processes\",\"