ion\":\"Supplies active, passive and electromechanical components to original equipment manufacturers and electronic manufacturing companies across tech sectors\",\"stats\":[{\"main\":\"Up to 90% faster\",\"sub\":\"sourcing and quote preparation\"},{\"main\":\"96% reduction\",\"sub\":\"in bills of materials preparation time\"},{\"main\":\"Up to $32,000\",\"sub\":\"in monthly productivity gains\"}],\"challenges\":[{\"title\":\"Unstructured Request For Quotation (RFQ) submissions\",\"desc\":\"RFQs arrived in multiple formats and increasing volumes, making them difficult to process, track and manage efficiently\"},{\"title\":\"Inaccurate and error-prone matching\",\"desc\":\"Manual product and brand matching increased the risk of quoting inaccuracies and cause unnecessary followups\"},{\"title\":\"Fragmented supplier information\",\"desc\":\"Supplier pricing and lead-time information was scattered across emails and records\"}],\"solution\":{\"intro\":\"Atlas (AI RFQ-to-Fulfilment Platform)\",\"descMain\":\"Uses AI to transform RFQ and supplier data into structured, searchable information\",\"descSub\":\"Automates RFQ processing and sourcing workflows - help teams improve accuracy, reduce manual effort and respond to customer requests more efficiently\",\"items\":[{\"title\":\"AI-enabled RFQ processing\",\"desc\":\"Extracts customer and product requirements from emails, PDFs, spreadsheets and other RFQ formats into structured data\"},{\"title\":\"Intelligent product matching\",\"desc\":\"Matches requested products and brands against supplier information to streamline sourcing and quotation workflows\"},{\"title\":\"Supplier intelligence and sourcing\",\"desc\":\"Extracts supplier prices, inventory and lead times from emails while identifying stock availability, supplier options and product alternatives\"},{\"title\":\"Automated RFQ workflow\",\"desc\":\"Centralises RFQ and supplier information while automating supplier outreach, making information easier to search, trac